! _POC-XRLDP RT01(IOL・P・BGP なし)。LDP は有効(同期・targeted の受け入れ・パスワードは PoC の段で足す)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.11 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description PRIMARY to XR01
 ip address 10.0.1.11 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to RT02
 ip address 10.0.12.11 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0011.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
